  "ai_summary": "Devs aren't totally cooked yet. While IT consultancy stocks are collapsing (-35.87% YoY, -25.9% 30-day), pricing in AI disruption for outsourced labor, broader signals remain resilient. Indeed postings show strong 1-year growth (+21.7%) despite a flat 30-day trend (+1.99%). Big Tech headcounts are stable (-3.2% YoY, flat 30-day), and AI labs like Anthropic show massive YoY surges (+221%) alongside continued 30-day hiring (+33 jobs), defying replacement fears. Anthropic is hiring like crazy because nothing screams \"we are replacing software engineers\" quite like onboarding hundreds of new people to figure out why the last model hallucinated the entire billing system.",
